<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill rises to 8.19 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill rises to 8.19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it set a cut-off price of 98.00 rupees at the weekly five-billion rupee auction of 91-day treasury bills against 98.03 rupees at the previous week's auction.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield rose to 8.19 percent from 8.06 percent.</p>
